{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意⚠️ 】如果你家中有長者，請立即分享提醒他們！</p><p>近日，大量香港及台灣 WhatsApp 用戶又再收到冒充官方的 WhatsApp 帳戶騎劫詐騙訊息。</p><p>騙徒會發送名為「WhatsApp 安全中心提醒」或「WhatsApp 安全檢查中心」的卡片貼圖，並故意在圖片中加入「綠色剔號」標誌偽裝成官方認證，切勿點擊不明連結或透露任何安全代碼。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:48.509056+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:22.793845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:24.047188+00:00","content_hash":"475475c9ec560e842aaaf3f215b01d60a827e581fb1a328ec5fca4294c106ec4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}